rac{∂y}{∂t}+\\frac{∂f}{∂z}\\cdot \\frac{∂z}{∂t}\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives of $f$ with respect to $x,y$ and $z:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x}=yz,\\,\\frac{∂f}{∂y}=xz,\\,\\frac{∂f}{∂z}=xy.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWriting the above results in terms of $s$ and $t,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂x} & =ts{e}^{t+s}, \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂y} & =2t{e}^{s}, \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂z} & =2s{e}^{t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we take the derivatives of $x,$ $y,$ and $z$ with respect to $t,$ and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂t} & =0, \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂t} & =s{e}^{t}, \\\\ \\frac{∂z}{∂t} & ={e}^{s}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting all of our derivatives into the multivariable chain rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂t} & =(ts{e}^{t+s})\\cdot 0+(2t{e}^{s})\\cdot s{e}^{t}+(2s{e}^{t})\\cdot {e}^{s} \\\\  & =2ts{e}^{t+s}+2s{e}^{t+s} \\\\  & =2s(t+1){e}^{t+s}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534968 true] [17592186323412 1000 #edb/ref 17592186323413 13194139534968 true] [17592186323412 1000 #edb/ref 17592186323414 13194139534968 true] [17592186323412 1000 #edb/ref 17592186323415 13194139534968 true] [17592186323412 1000 #edb/ref 17592186323416 13194139534968 true] [17592186323412 1000 #edb/ref 17592186323417 13194139534968 true] [17592186323412 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534968 true] [17592186323412 1041 "selection" 13194139534968 true] [17592186323412 1104 #edb/ref 17592186323415 13194139534968 true] [17592186323412 1110 #uuid "b498291b-53fd-50bf-af45-63cad4c51b73" 13194139534968 true] [17592186323413 1034 "2(t+s){e}^{t+s}" 13194139534968 true] [17592186323413 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534968 true] [17592186323413 1111 #uuid "0d89b8cf-6caf-5298-9440-92429d6ddf4d" 13194139534968 true] [17592186323414 1034 "4(t-s){e}^{t+s}" 13194139534968 true] [17592186323414 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534968 true] [17592186323414 1111 #uuid "fa889f70-284b-55c3-988d-184cc294d6e6" 13194139534968 true] [17592186323415 1034 "2s